sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Browser
    participant Router as OpenShift Router<br/>443/TCP HTTPS edge TLS
    participant UI as ui (Streamlit)<br/>8501/TCP HTTP
    participant BE as backend (FastAPI)<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant LLM as Ollama 11434/TCP HTTP<br/>or Vertex/OpenAI 443/TCP HTTPS
    participant DB as SQLite (PVC)
    participant MC as Model Catalog<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KS as KServe Controller
    participant Ext as HuggingFace / AA<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,MC: Flow 1: Use case to recommendation
    User->>Router: HTTPS 443 (no auth)
    Router->>UI: HTTP/WebSocket 8501 (plaintext)
    UI->>BE: POST /api/v1/extract (no auth)
    BE->>LLM: Intent extraction prompt<br/>None / GCP creds / Bearer API key
    LLM-->>BE: DeploymentIntent JSON
    UI->>BE: POST /generate-specification, /generate-recommendations
    alt PLANNER_BENCHMARK_SOURCE=database
        BE->>DB: Query benchmarks (local file)
    else PLANNER_BENCHMARK_SOURCE=model_catalog
        BE->>MC: GET /api/model_catalog/v1alpha1<br/>Bearer token or SA token, service-CA TLS
        MC-->>BE: Validated model performance data
    end
    BE-->>UI: Ranked configurations

    Note over UI,KS: Flow 2: Generate and deploy
    UI->>BE: POST /api/v1/generate-deployment
    BE-->>UI: KServe / llm-d YAML (Jinja2)
    UI->>BE: POST /api/v1/deploy-bundle-to-cluster<br/>arbitrary YAML + caller-chosen namespace (no auth)
    BE->>K8s: kubectl create namespace, kubectl apply -f -<br/>Backend SA token or kubeconfig, TLS
    K8s-->>BE: Applied
    KS->>K8s: Reconcile InferenceService (vLLM or simulator)

    Note over BE,K8s: Flow 3: GPU detection
    BE->>K8s: list nodes (label nvidia.com/gpu.product)<br/>SA token (planner-gpu-reader)
    K8s-->>BE: Node list (cached by TTL)

    Note over BE,Ext: Flow 4: Quality data refresh
    UI->>BE: POST /api/v1/quality/refresh (no auth)
    BE->>Ext: lmarena-ai/leaderboard-dataset (optional HF_TOKEN)
    BE->>Ext: Artificial Analysis API v2 (AA_API_KEY)
    Ext-->>BE: Quality scores
